  i Vue already defaults an absent Boolean prop to false. A default of true means the prop can only be turned off by explicitly passing false.
  
  i Remove the default value. If the prop should be enabled by default, invert its name and meaning instead, for example disabled instead of enabled.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

